{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# FRIEND — the Shadow Mantle Holder\n\nCatalogued alongside Knight, Voice, and Man. Linked to the 'Strange Someone' circle.","x":-190,"y":-80,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Forgotten Man**\nSame 'Other' group on the official wiki.","x":-130,"y":-538,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"3"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Spamton NEO**\nHis glasses match the color of FRIEND's eyes. His gear resists Cat damage, and the blue circle from Pipis was a gift from him to Noelle.","x":320,"y":164,"width":270,"height":190,"color":"3"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Everyman**\nEaster eggs from the same minor-mystery category.","x":-580,"y":164,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"1"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Man_overworld_tree.gif","x":-129,"y":-938,"width":221,"height":190},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Spamton_NEO_battle.gif","x":669,"y":306,"width":133,"height":190},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/everyman.png","x":-920,"y":303,"width":251,"height":190},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**The Prophecy's tail from hell?**\nSame chained-circle aesthetic as the Cat Petterz 2 mascots.","x":320,"y":-538,"width":280,"height":170,"color":"3"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Dess**\nDid Kris, Asriel, Noelle, and Dess summon it as children? A clue from the Organikk about the forest.","x":-580,"y":-538,"width":280,"height":170,"color":"1"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Mad Mew Mew (Pink)**\nReveals that they're 'protein' and a pack of cats, not a single individual.","x":700,"y":-70,"width":270,"height":160,"color":"4"},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/prophecy-identification-v0-jtgejdcm3m6f1.webp","x":700,"y":-940,"width":260,"height":161},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Dess.png","x":-960,"y":-940,"width":91,"height":190},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Pink_screenshot_cat_bite.png","x":1050,"y":-140,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s_rarecats","type":"text","text":"**Rare cats minigame (ARG, 2025)** Written by Noelle: FRIEND has a 0.1% chance of appearing and delivering a jumpscare — its first appearance outside the game itself.","x":-130,"y":450,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_antagonista_final","type":"text","text":"**Final antagonist of Deltarune?**\nTheorized as a possible culprit behind much of the past's mysterious events — including Dess's disappearance — and Kris's own trauma. Widely held among fans, without textual confirmation.","x":-960,"y":690,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"3"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/FRIEND.png","x":-113,"y":-270,"width":205,"height":190}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img-e","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img-e","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img-e","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"s3-img-e","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s4-img-e","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s5-img-e","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s5","toSide":"right","color":"6"},{"id":"e_rarecats","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_rarecats","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_antagonista_final","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_antagonista_final","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_forgottenman_cola","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_spamton_pink","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_dess_antagonista","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_antagonista_final","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_rarecats_pink","fromNode":"s_rarecats","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s5","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_everyman_forgottenman","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s0","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_cola_spamton","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"1"}]}